              "$|z| = \\sqrt{1^2 + 1^2} = \\sqrt{2}$ និងអាគុយម៉ង់ $\\theta = \\dfrac{\\pi}{4}$។",
              "$z = \\sqrt{2}\\left(\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi}{4} + i\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$",
              "តាមរូបមន្តដឺម័រ៖ $z^8 = (\\sqrt{2})^8 \\left(\\cos 2\\pi + i\\sin 2\\pi\\right) = 16 \\cdot 1 = 16$"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
